{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1", "title": "XM Zheng's Blog", "home_page_url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/", "feed_url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/feed_json_updated.json", "description": null, "icon": null, "authors": [], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/a-complete-guide-to-cloudflare-cdn-and-domain-optimization/", "url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/a-complete-guide-to-cloudflare-cdn-and-domain-optimization/", "title": "A complete guide to Cloudflare CDN and domain optimization", "content_html": "<h1>A complete guide to Cloudflare CDN and domain optimization</h1>\n<p>\u672c\u6559\u7a0b\u5c06\u4ecb\u7ecd\u5982\u4f55\u4f7f\u7528 Cloudflare CDN \u548c\u4f18\u9009\u57df\u540d\u6765\u52a0\u901f\u7ad9\u70b9\u7684\u8bbf\u95ee\u3002</p>", "image": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/assets/images/social/posts/a-complete-guide-to-cloudflare-cdn-and-domain-optimization.png", "date_modified": "2026-07-23T13:28:56+00:00", "date_published": "2026-07-23T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["Guide", "Web"]}, {"id": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/a-fast-method-for-partial-fraction-decomposition/", "url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/a-fast-method-for-partial-fraction-decomposition/", "title": "A fast method for partial fraction decomposition", "content_html": "<h1>A fast method for partial fraction decomposition</h1>\n<p>!!! warning \"Generated by AI\"</p>\n<p>\u8be5\u65b9\u6cd5\u9002\u7528\u4e8e\u53e3\u7b97</p>", "image": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/assets/images/social/posts/a-fast-method-for-partial-fraction-decomposition.png", "date_modified": "2026-07-23T13:28:56+00:00", "date_published": "2025-11-22T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["Math", "Studying"]}, {"id": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/fix-semicolon-parsing-logic-within-comments-in-sicps-sqlite-shell-py/", "url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/fix-semicolon-parsing-logic-within-comments-in-sicps-sqlite-shell-py/", "title": "Fix semicolon parsing logic within comments in SICP's sqlite_shell.py", "content_html": "<h1>Fix semicolon parsing logic within comments in SICP's <code>sqlite_shell.py</code></h1>\n<p>SICP \u7684 <code>sqlite_shell.py</code> \u975e\u5e38\u795e\u5947\u7684\u65e0\u6cd5\u5904\u7406 <code>/* */</code> \u4e2d\u7684 <code>;</code>\uff0c\u4f1a\u4ea7\u751f\u62a5\u9519\uff1a</p>\n<p><code>bash\nsqlite&gt; /*;*/;\nnear \"*\": syntax error</code></p>", "image": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/assets/images/social/posts/fix-semicolon-parsing-logic-within-comments-in-sicps-sqlite-shell-py.png", "date_modified": "2026-07-23T13:28:56+00:00", "date_published": "2025-12-28T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["SICP", "Studying"]}, {"id": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/from-hash-tables-to-dictionaries-the-missing-part-of-sicp/", "url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/from-hash-tables-to-dictionaries-the-missing-part-of-sicp/", "title": "From hash tables to dictionaries: the missing part of SICP", "content_html": "<h1>From hash tables to dictionaries: <br> the missing part of SICP</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\u7b14\u8005\u5728\u7814\u8bfb <a href=\"https://github.com/KEDIT2007/NJU-SICP-Essays/blob/main/dict-and-python-oop/Dictionaries%20and%20Python%20OOP.md\">Dictionaries and Python OOP</a> \u7684\u65f6\u5019\u610f\u8bc6\u5230\u81ea\u5df1\u5bf9 Python \u5b57\u5178\u7684\u5b9e\u73b0\u4e86\u89e3\u4e0d\u591f\uff0c\u4fbf\u5728\u8fd9\u4e00\u65b9\u5411\u8fdb\u884c\u4e86\u6df1\u5165\u63a2\u7d22\u3002</p>\n<p>\u6211\u4eec\u7684 <a href=\"https://sicp.pascal-lab.net/2025/\">SICP</a> \u8bfe\u7a0b\u6ca1\u6709\u6d89\u53ca\u8fd9\u4e00\u6570\u636e\u7ed3\u6784\uff0c\u6211\u76f8\u4fe1\u4e5f\u6709\u5176\u4ed6\u5b66\u4e60\u8005\u60f3\u8981\u6df1\u5165\u4e86\u89e3\u5b57\u5178\u7684\u5b9e\u73b0\u539f\u7406\uff1b\u56e0\u6b64\u6211\u4e0d\u59a8\u5199\u4e00\u4efd\u8bb2\u4e49\uff0c\u6765\u7cfb\u7edf\u5730\u8bb2\u89e3 Python \u5b57\u5178\u7684\u8bbe\u8ba1\u601d\u60f3\uff0c\u5e0c\u671b\u540e\u6765\u8005\u4e5f\u80fd\u5c11\u8d70\u4e00\u4e9b\u5f2f\u8def\u3002</p>\n</blockquote>", "image": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/assets/images/social/posts/from-hash-tables-to-dictionaries-the-missing-part-of-sicp.png", "date_modified": "2026-07-23T13:28:56+00:00", "date_published": "2026-01-17T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["SICP", "Studying"]}, {"id": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/git-tutorial-for-dlco/", "url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/git-tutorial-for-dlco/", "title": "Git tutorial for DLCO", "content_html": "<h1>Git tutorial for DLCO</h1>\n<p>\u5728\u6b64\u7b80\u8ff0\u5982\u4f55\u5728\u5b9e\u9a8c\u5e73\u53f0\u4e2d\u914d\u7f6e\u7f51\u7edc\u8fde\u63a5\uff0c\u5e76\u4e0e NJU Git \u540c\u6b65\u3002</p>", "image": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/assets/images/social/posts/git-tutorial-for-dlco.png", "date_modified": "2026-07-23T13:28:56+00:00", "date_published": "2026-04-09T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["DLCO", "Guide"]}, {"id": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/how-to-build-a-pastebin-website/", "url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/how-to-build-a-pastebin-website/", "title": "How to build a pastebin website", "content_html": "<h1>How to build a pastebin website</h1>\n<p>\u8fd1\u65e5\u7ed9\u539f\u6765\u7684 Pastebin \u6362\u4e86\u4e00\u4e2a\u670d\u52a1\u5668\uff0c\u91cd\u65b0\u90e8\u7f72\u4e00\u904d\uff0c\u6b63\u597d\u5199\u4e00\u7bc7\u6559\u7a0b\u3002</p>\n<p>\u6211\u9009\u62e9\u7684\u662f <a href=\"https://privatebin.info/\">PrivateBin</a>\u3002</p>", "image": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/assets/images/social/posts/how-to-build-a-pastebin-website.png", "date_modified": "2026-07-23T13:28:56+00:00", "date_published": "2026-01-06T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["Studying"]}, {"id": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/i-set-up-my-homepage/", "url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/i-set-up-my-homepage/", "title": "I set up my homepage!", "content_html": "<h1>I set up my homepage!</h1>", "image": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/assets/images/social/posts/i-set-up-my-homepage.png", "date_modified": "2026-07-23T13:28:56+00:00", "date_published": "2025-12-27T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["Living"]}, {"id": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/markdown-macros-for-typora/", "url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/markdown-macros-for-typora/", "title": "Markdown macros for Typora", "content_html": "<h1>Markdown macros for Typora</h1>\n<p>\u6ce8\u610f\u62ec\u53f7\u7684 4 \u4e2a\u53ea\u6709 Typora \u80fd\u7528\uff0c\u56e0\u5176\u8f83\u4e3a\u7279\u522b\u7684 MathJax \u914d\u7f6e\u3002</p>\n<p>\u4e0d\u5efa\u8bae\u7528\u8fd9 4 \u4e2a\uff0c\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u4e0d\u53ea\u7528 Typora \u7684\u8bdd\u3002</p>", "image": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/assets/images/social/posts/markdown-macros-for-typora.png", "date_modified": "2026-07-23T13:28:56+00:00", "date_published": "2025-12-13T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["Math", "Studying"]}, {"id": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/organized-notes-of-mit-1801sc/", "url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/organized-notes-of-mit-1801sc/", "title": "Organized notes of MIT 18.01SC", "content_html": "<h1>Organized notes of MIT 18.01SC</h1>\n<h3>Description:</h3>\n<p>An archive of MIT 18.01SC Single Variable Calculus Fall 2010 with organized notes, problem sets and exams.</p>", "image": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/assets/images/social/posts/organized-notes-of-mit-1801sc.png", "date_modified": "2026-07-23T13:28:56+00:00", "date_published": "2025-08-26T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["Math", "Studying"]}, {"id": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/some-questions-i-set/", "url": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/posts/some-questions-i-set/", "title": "Some questions I set", "content_html": "<h1>Some questions I set</h1>\n<p>\u662f\u4e00\u4e9b\u5f88\u4e71\u7684\u4e00\u4e2a\u6574\u7406\uff0c\u4ece\u5bb6\u91cc\u7ffb\u51fa\u6765\u7684\u4e00\u5806\u4e1c\u897f\u3002\u6ca1\u4ec0\u4e48\u7528\u3002</p>\n<p>\u53ea\u662f\u89c9\u5f97\u5f03\u4e4b\u53ef\u60dc\u3002</p>", "image": "https://blog.xmzheng.cn/assets/images/social/posts/some-questions-i-set.png", "date_modified": "2026-07-23T13:28:56+00:00", "d